Mixed Rights Notice for ALD/E-ImageMiner

This repository contains annotations, generated metadata, extracted figure
images, code, and documentation for the ALD/E-ImageMiner benchmark.

The repository is distributed as a mixed-rights resource. No blanket open
license is granted for all figure images, source-paper content, or other
third-party material. Figure images originate from many scientific
publications and may carry article-specific copyrights or reuse terms.

Source article PDFs are intentionally excluded from the GitHub release.
Users are responsible for checking each source article and rights holder
terms before reusing, redistributing, or commercially using any image or
source-derived content.

Where an individual file or subdirectory includes a separate license notice,
that notice applies to that file or subdirectory.
